                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11 N 15/135: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-24T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>135. Your telegram 260, April 23, 5 p.m., Section 2, paragraph 4. Department
                    approves your recommendation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
